'''Narita Kaihime''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] doubles her health and improves the chance of dealing [[Savage Blow|Savage Blows]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] increases health and range, doubles the speed, further improves Savage Blow chance and grants [[Explosion]] and [[Sage Slayer]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]].

