==Trivia==
*Narita Kaihime was an important heroine in the Sengoku period. She and her family killed many people of the Sanada family, though [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]] wasn't killed.
*She was the first unit to get Savage Blow.

